<title>USA: UGI Corp to buy back 400,000 shrs.</title>
<headline>UGI Corp to buy back 400,000 shrs.</headline>
<dateline>VALLEY FORGE, Pa. 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>UGI Corp said Tuesday it will repurchase up to 400,000 shares of common stock from time to time on the open market.</p>
<p>As of the end of April the company had 33.2 million common shares outstanding.</p>
<p>The stock was up 1/8 at 23-1/4 in mid-afternoon trading Tuesday.</p>
</text>
